    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838950/extras/2eca96de6084b30dd87390267ba6a576.poster.avif?t=1753054721\" width=616 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838950/extras/2eca96de6084b30dd87390267ba6a576.webm?t=1753054721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838950/extras/d508e1032bffef12948406e416b162fd.avif?t=1753054721\" data-has-big width=800 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In War for Westeros, chaos reigns in ruthless free-for-all battles where trust is fleeting and power is everything. Command the Great Houses in epic real-time strategy battles, forge strategic alliances, or weave deceit against your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838950/extras/7c0e2fca0a63e124fb684a17af0d667b.poster.avif?t=1753054721\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838950/extras/7c0e2fca0a63e124fb684a17af0d667b.webm?t=1753054721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838950/extras/d107e8120164f41a5c4b1625a9a002e5.poster.avif?t=1753054721\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap